\noindent
\textbf{Fact(1o).} The collision-collision orbit $K$ intersects the $q_1$-axis in exactly  $k+l$ points. These intersection points are ordered as
\begin{center}
    $\frac{l-1}{2}$ single points, $E$, $k-1$ single points, $M$, $\frac{l-1}{2}$ single points
\end{center}


