\textbf{Backbone.} We found that the optimization converges much better if first few modules are not routed, meaning they process all tokens and that choice is hard-coded. We refer to these few layers as \emph{backbone} and denote the number of layers in the backbone as $N_b$. In our experiments $N_b=0,1,2$.


