The intensity distribution of the numerical result is along the propagation direction, where the input state is a SHS with $|\tilde{\psi}_{i_s}\rangle$, with $E/\kappa =0.109i $. A barrier of $0.9 \kappa$ is applied as a perturbation to waveguides $n\le4$ between $z \in [2Z, 5Z]$. (b) The same situation applies to the initial state being the skin mode with $E/\kappa = -0.120-0.001i$. A barrier of $0.4 \kappa$ is applied to waveguides $n\le2$  between $z \in [2Z, 5Z]$. (c) (d)  $\eta(z)$ (red lines) and $\zeta(z)$ (blue lines) for (a) and (b), respectively.}
