\end{equation}
The values of the parameters $F_\Omega$ in \eqref{Fdef} and  $x_0$, $y_0$, $v_{x_0}$, $v_{y_0}$, $r_{x_0}$, and $r_{y_0}$ in \eqref{eldef} are listed in  Table~~\ref{table:LJ8_MLCV_committor_detail}.
