		The idempotents $\{T^{(r,s)}_{l}E^{(r,s)}_{\rho^{i}}, \ 1\leq i\leq p^{s}, \ \text{and} \ (i,p^{s}) =1 \}_{0\leq l \leq p^{r-s}-1}$,  $1\leq s\leq r$, form a set of mutually orthogonal primitive idempotents that are conjugate, giving rise to an irreducible representation of degree $p^{s-1}(p-1)$, for every $l$ and for every $s$.
