\section{Conclusion}
We introduce \textbf{LearnLens}, a dual-view feedback system that supports both teachers and students through curriculum-aligned assessment and personalised feedback. By combining LLM capabilities with human-in-the-loop design, LearnLens reduces teacher workload and enhances student learning, offering a practical path toward scalable, classroom-ready AI assistance.
While LearnLens shows promise in supporting teachers, we acknowledge the lack of student evaluation and plan to address this in future work.


