\begin{proof}
By (\ref{cost1}) and (\ref{cost2}), the difference $\mathcal{J}_i(u_{0i}(\check{u}_{1i}^+)(\cdot),\check{u}_{1i}^+(\cdot))-J_i(u_{0i}(u_{1i}^+)(\cdot),u_{1i}^+(\cdot))$ can be rewritten as
\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
	&\mathcal{J}_i(u_{0i}(\check{u}_{1i}^+)(\cdot),\check{u}_{1i}^+(\cdot))-J_i(u_{0i}(u_{1i}^+)(\cdot),u_{1i}^+(\cdot))\\
