    &=\mathbb{E}\bigg\{\int_0^T\left[\left\langle\tilde{Q}(\check{x}_i-x_i^+),\check{x}_i-x_i^+\right\rangle +2\left\langle\tilde{Q}x_i^+,\check{x}_i-x_i^+\right\rangle +\left\langle\tilde{\Gamma}_1^\top\tilde{Q}\tilde{\Gamma}_1\left(\check{x}^{(N)}-m^+\right),\check{x}^{(N)}-m^+\right\rangle\right.\\
