\begin{center}
\includegraphics[scale=0.4]{fig4_prl}
\caption{Reaction cross section $^{12}$C($^{4}$He, reac) as a function of the projectile laboratory energy $E_{lab}$. The solid red line is the result of our microscopic OP,
the dashed red line is obtained rescaling the imaginary part of our OP by a factor 0.5. Experimental data are shown by filled coloured symbols with the corresponding error 
