\section{Conclusions}

\label{sec:conclusion}

This paper introduces \name, a novel equivalence checking tool. \name leverages the dynamic rule generation to effectively verify complex control flow transformations. By integrating both static datapath rewriting rules with dynamic, code-specific rules, \name provides a flexible verification solution. Our experimental results demonstrate its efficiency, verifying various code transformations within an efficient runtime. Finally, \name successfully identifies a few critical compilation errors, covering functional incorrectness and data hazard violations. 

