        &= \min_{H\in \left\{ F_l, F_h \right\}} \left(1-2H(\hat\theta)\right)F_h(\theta_1) + H(\hat\theta) \\
        &= \min_{H\in \left\{ F_l, F_h \right\}} \left(1-2F_h(\theta_1)\right)H(\hat\theta) + F_h(\theta_1) \\
        &= \left(1-2F_h(\theta_1)\right)F_h(\hat\theta) + F_h(\theta_1)
