        \ubar v_1\left(tr \mid \theta_1, \sigma_2^{\hat\theta} \right)
        = \left( 1-2F_h(\hat\theta)\right)F_h(\theta_1)+F_h(\hat\theta) = \left( 1-2F_h(\theta_1)\right)F_h(\hat\theta)+F_h(\theta_1).
