    We know from Theorem \ref{thm:existence_uniqueness_ambiguous_cursed_KNE} that there exist symmetric cursed Knight-Nash equilibria with thresholds in $\left(\tfrac{1}{2},F_l^{-1}\left(\tfrac{1}{2}\right)\right)$ that can be found by solving Equation \eqref{eq:threshold_equation_ambigous_CKNE}.\footnote{
    Regarding $\F_{\eps}$, the same disclaimer as in Footnote \ref{fn:disclaimer_F_eps} applies.
    }
    In the cases at hand, the thresholds in the equilibria are 
