Recent work on WM, however, falls short in either domain generality (cite Genie-2, Cosmos), world richness (cite World Labs), action controllability (cite Sora, Veo-2, etc.), or practical usability (cite V-JEPA, PLDM, etc.). In particular, there is a frequently-heard school of thought regarding world models (cite Yann LeCun), which we found to warrant closer examination:
