This choice of $\delta$ gives a sparser DAG compared to smaller values, and thus may facilitate interpretation.

In addition to the nSHD distances, we also consider the stability score between different DAGs as defined in \citet[Lemma~1]{TBK}, which, for fixed $\delta$, is given by: 
