\section{Concluding remarks}

In this paper, integrated and unintegrated vertex operators have been constructed in flat spacetime and in the background with the geometry of $AdS_5\times S^5$. It would be interesting to perform a similar construction in a generic background geometry as it is done in \cite{Chandia:2018nyh,Chandia:2019paj} in the pure spinor formalism. A more ambitious goals would be to study scattering amplitudes and to compactify superstrings as it is done in \cite{Chandia:2022uyy,Chandia:2024rze} for pure spinor strings.




